      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "おらたちの村は何にもねえけんども……\n眺めが良くて、それはそれは綺麗な海が見られるだ！\n海の神様にその感謝を込めて祭りさ開きたい。\n奉納の踊りを、だれかに頼めんもんかいのう？",
        "official_en": "Our village doesn't have much, but we do have a\nbeautiful view of the ocean! We'd like to throw a\nfestival to thank the god of the sea. Could you come\nand perform a dance for us?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
